# 构建上下文排除项：镜像里只需要运行期代码、依赖与入口脚本。
.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes
node_modules
data
test
audit
.mimosa
.playwright-mcp
.zcode
*.png
# 默认液态玻璃壁纸是运行期资源，不能跟着截图一起排除
!ui/assets/liquid-wallpaper.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.tar.gz
*.zip
_staging
# 本地运行/compose 产生的敏感物：只要有一样进镜像，令牌或 QQ 登录态就跟着镜像走了。
.env
.env.*
snowluma
snowluma-data
snowluma-client-config
snowluma-client-data
backups
console-access.txt
deployment-access.txt
config.json
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.sqlite3
*.log
.deployment.json
.deployment-node
.console-tunnel.cfg
.npmrc
.netrc
.dbg/
.runtime/
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
# 宿主部署脚本不进镜像：容器里跑它们只会写半成品 / 调 systemd
deploy.sh
deploy-all.sh
install.sh
manage.sh
console-tunnel.bat
console-tunnel.sh
